 terials are selected for fixed properties and then protected with safety f
 actors\, because repeated loading degrades them. Living structural materia
 ls do the opposite: bone senses mechanical loading and converts it into mi
 neral deposition where stiffness is needed\, while coral self-stiffens as 
 waves cement its skeleton. This talk asks whether synthetic materials can 
 likewise use mech…\n\n地点：Maxwell Dworkin\, Room G115\n活动页：
